# Skip optional dependencies by default.
#
# Two big things are optional here and neither is needed to run the app:
#   @huggingface/transformers + onnxruntime  (~680 MB) — only for EMBED_PROVIDER=local
#   sharp's per-platform binaries            (~750 MB) — only for next/image, unused here
#
# Note: @llamaindex/env declares @huggingface/transformers as a peerOptional, so
# npm pulls it in unless optional deps are omitted — listing it as an optional
# peer in package.json is not enough on its own.
#
# To use EMBED_PROVIDER=local:  npm run local:install
omit=optional
